## Future Connectivity

The architecture can be extended with cellular and cloud connectivity for remote monitoring.

Possible future flow:

```text
Smart Watch
     ↓ BLE
Boat Hub
     ↓ LoRa / Cellular
Cloud Platform
     ↓
Mobile Application
```

## Development Status

The architecture represents the proposed prototype system. Individual communication links, sensors, emergency detection logic, and mechanical mechanisms require hardware-level testing and validation before the system can be considered operational.
